        <mxCell id="p6_cut" value="&lt;b&gt;If you fall behind, cut in this order:&lt;/b&gt; extensions → H2 regression and second-model depth → H3 → simple scoring fallback. &lt;b&gt;Never cut:&lt;/b&gt; core pipeline, H1, H2, H5, the human panel (shrink the comment list, not the raters), limitations, the leakage rule." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
